      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_02",
      "hash64": "23D036958FE33AD7",
      "text": "Sag bloß, du bist hier, um zu trainieren?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_03a",
      "hash64": "BE0452237F1A503F",
      "text": "Ich wusste doch, dass ich den Kampfgeist in\\ndeinen Augen gesehen habe![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_03b",
      "hash64": "BE0453237F1A51F2",
      "text": "Oh, Training ist natürlich Privatsache. Tut mir leid,\\ndass ich dich mit der Frage überfallen habe.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_04",
      "hash64": "23D034958FE33771",
      "text": "Hättest du Lust, gemeinsam eine Runde über den\\nSportplatz zu laufen? So könnten wir uns etwas\\r\\nbesser kennenlernen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_05",
      "hash64": "23D033958FE335BE",
      "text": "Dann mal los![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_system_01",
      "hash64": "5CE62BAF22FB929E",
      "text": "Du bist zusammen mit Señora Amura drei\\nRunden um den Sportplatz gelaufen...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_06",
      "hash64": "23D032958FE3340B",
      "text": "Puh, jetzt hab ich aber ordentlich geschwitzt![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_07",
      "hash64": "23D031958FE33258",
      "text": "Und du scheinst ein ganz brauchbares Paar Beine\\nzu haben, Neuzugang![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_08",
      "hash64": "23D030958FE330A5",
      "text": "Aber so ein Training macht ganz schön hungrig,\\nfindest du nicht auch?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_09",
      "hash64": "23D02F958FE32EF2",
      "text": "Zum Dank, dass du mir Gesellschaft geleistet\\nhast, bekommst du ein selbst gemachtes Sandwich\\r\\nvon mir. Damit kannst du deine Muskeln füttern![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_system_02",
      "hash64": "5CE62AAF22FB90EB",
      "text": "Señora Amuras Sandwich ist staubtrocken, riecht\\nstreng und schmeckt nach gar nichts...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_10",
      "hash64": "23CD32958FE0FE34",
      "text": "Na, hat’s dir geschmeckt?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_select_01",
      "hash64": "16F8CA5379943209",
      "text": "Ja, sehr lecker...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_select_02",
      "hash64": "16F8C75379942CF0",
      "text": "Also ehrlich gesagt...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_11",
      "hash64": "23CD33958FE0FFE7",
      "text": "Entschuldige, ich hätte gar nicht erst fragen\\nsollen...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_12",
      "hash64": "23CD34958FE1019A",
      "text": "Mit Sport kenne ich mich aus, aber wenn es um\\ndas Zubereiten von Essen geht, bin ich eine Null.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_13",
      "hash64": "23CD35958FE1034D",
      "text": "Und deine ehrliche Reaktion hat mir das wieder\\nvor Augen geführt...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_14",
      "hash64": "23CD2E958FE0F768",
      "text": "Also dann, man sieht sich! Freu dich schon mal\\nauf den Muskelkater, hehe.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_system_03",
      "hash64": "5CE629AF22FB8F38",
      "text": "Du bist ein wenig mit Señora Amura warm\\ngeworden!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
